==Asturian==

=====Alternative forms=====
* {{alter|ast|char||interchangeable}}
* {{alter|ast|eichar||Western Asturias}}
* {{alter|ast|etsar||Quirós}}
* {{alter|ast|ichar||Cunqueiru}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|ast|LL.|iecto|iectāre}}, from {{der|ast|la|iacto|iactāre}}. Probably borrowed via {{bor|ast|es|echar}} since it's present also in Western dialects (where ''*xeitar'' would be the expected result). Doublet of {{dbt|ast|axeitar|notext=1}}, formed from {{l|ast|xeitu}}, western result of {{noncog|la|iactus}}

===Pronunciation===
{{ast-pr}}

