# to [[throw up]], [[vomit]]
#: {{syn|ast|devolver|gomitar}}
# to [[emit]]
#: {{ux|ast|Esa flor '''echa''' muncha grana|That flower '''emits''' a lot of pollen}}
# to [[kick out]], [[expel]]
#: {{syn|ast|espulsar|botar}}
