# to [[sprout]]
#: {{syn|ast|biltar|campiar}}
#: {{ux|ast|Los praos '''echen''' agora de primavera|The fields '''sprout''' now that it is spring}}
# to [[serve]] [[food]]
#: {{ux|ast|Nun m''''eches''' más pote|Don't '''serve''' me more stew}}
# to [[lay down]], [[put to sleep]]
