#: {{ux|ast|¿Cuanto '''eches''' que tien dientro'l bolsu?|How much do you '''guess''' she/he has inside her/his pocket?}}
# to [[spend]], [[use]] [[money]]
#: {{syn|ast|gastar}}
#: {{ux|ast|Valte más '''echar''' les perres en chicolate|It's better if you '''spend''' the money in chocolate}}
# to [[prepare]] (a [[meal]] or [[clothes]]) for someone who [[departs]]
