#: {{ux|ast|'''Échame''' la merienda que marcho|'''Prepare''' a meal for me, I'm leaving}}
# to [[put on]], [[play]] (a film or TV show)
#: {{ux|ast|Tan '''echando''' un nuevu programa nesta canal|They are '''putting on''' a new show on this channel}}
# to [[forget]], to get out of one's head
#: {{syn|ast|posar|escaecer}}
#: {{ux|ast|Nun soi a '''echar''' lo que mi dixo|I can't '''forget''' what he/she said to me}}
# to [[hold]] [[mass]]
#: {{ux|ast|'''Charon''' una misa pol padre|'''They held''' a mass in honour of the father}}
# to [[hunt]] an [[animal]]

